OL,3,GNEWSAArtwork on doomed city car park to
OL,4,Abe saved
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artwork installed on the wall of a
OL,7,Fcar park set for demolition will be
OL,8,Fsaved.
OL,10,FThe piece, named Traffic Flow, was
OL,11,Fcommissioned in 1986 to help brighten
OL,12,Fup a corrugated concrete wall beneath
OL,13,Fthe NCP car park in Maid Marian Way in
OL,14,FNottingham.
OL,16,FHomes England, the government's housing
OL,17,Fand regeneration agency, bought the
OL,18,Fsite in March 2025, and plans to
OL,19,Fbulldoze the car park as part of a
OL,20,Fwider project in the Broad Marsh area
OL,21,Fof the city.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
